{"id":"b933761613d185b9","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-myhill-characterization.md","title":"Myhill Characterization","display":"thm-myhill-characterization — Myhill Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-myhill-characterization","aliases":["68-thm-myhill-characterization"],"display":"thm-myhill-characterization — Myhill Characterization","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-creative-set]]","[[68-df-productive-set]]","[[68-df-halting-set]]","[[68-df-one-one-reducibility]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"External Myhill characterization preserved from prior atom; external source not checked","verification_status":"external-source-unverified","source_proof_status":"not-checked","external_verification_status":"unverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-myhill-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-myhill-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-myhill-characterization — Myhill Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2afdb06f05dacdb0\" href=\"?note=2afdb06f05dacdb0\" title=\"68-df-creative-set\">68-df-creative-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e63c3a4e8bd71ca4\" href=\"?note=e63c3a4e8bd71ca4\" title=\"68-df-productive-set\">68-df-productive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eab12566d8ac44ad\" href=\"?note=eab12566d8ac44ad\" title=\"68-df-halting-set\">68-df-halting-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"007638c1acc7d921\" href=\"?note=007638c1acc7d921\" title=\"68-df-one-one-reducibility\">68-df-one-one-reducibility</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"External Myhill characterization preserved from prior atom; external source not checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"external-source-unverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"},{"key":"external_verification_status","html":"unverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar A=\\mathbb N\\setminus A\">\\(\\bar A=\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative},\\mathrm{Productive},K,\\equiv_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative},\\mathrm{Productive},K,\\equiv_1\\)</span> 见所列直接依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Productive}(\\bar A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\equiv_1 K.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Productive}(\\bar A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\equiv_1 K.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留旧 creative-set-characterization-theorem 原子中的外部等价链，并补齐不可省略的 A∈RE 前提。所供 Shoenfield 书中 17.1 证明 creative 当且仅当 RE many-one complete，未定位这一 productive/one-one 的 Myhill 延伸及其证明；本原子仅保存原有外部内容，未完成外部文献核验，不能当作已核验依赖。拆分使原书 17.1 的证据状态与这条外部结论各自可查。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"2afdb06f05dacdb0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-creative-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-productive-set","status":"resolved","id":"e63c3a4e8bd71ca4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-productive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"eab12566d8ac44ad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-halting-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-one-one-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"007638c1acc7d921","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-one-one-reducibility]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar A=\\mathbb N\\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative},\\mathrm{Productive},K,\\equiv_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Productive}(\\bar A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\equiv_1 K.","display":true}],"bytes":1530,"backlinks":[{"id":"719191db2e194527","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 17.1，印刷 p.63 / PDF p.72。若 A 为 RE 完全集，取将对角 RE 集 K 归约至 A 的全递归 F，再由参数定理取 S 使 W_(S(e))(x)↔W_e(F(x))；令 G(e)=F(S(e)) 即得到 creating function。反向，若 F creating，给任意 RE 集 B 取全递归 S 使 W_(S(x))(y)↔x∈B，则 x∈B↔F(S(x))∈A。两向均按原书证明复核。旧原子中补集生产性与一一完备性的外部等价结论另保存在 [[68-thm-myhill-characterization]]，与本书 17.1 的核验状态分开。"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-myhill-characterization]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-myhill-characterization|thm-myhill-characterization — Myhill Characterization]]"}],"outgoing":["913d52943499d039","2afdb06f05dacdb0","e63c3a4e8bd71ca4","eab12566d8ac44ad","007638c1acc7d921"]}